  "helpBody1a": "You can open VibeTours as a guest to explore approved tours, nearby places, basic map, and public details.",
  "helpBody1b": "To create tours, save favorites to the cloud, comment, rate, send PQRS, or check availability, you need to sign in.",
  "helpBody1c": "If you try a private action, VibeTours will display a 'Sign in to continue' prompt without losing what you were viewing.",
  "helpBody1d": "Email login remains available. If Google is configured, you can also sign in with your Google account.",
  "helpBody2a": "The Discover section shows featured places using your location and nearby recommendations.",
  "helpBody2b": "If the search bar is empty, you will see popular or nearby recommendations so the screen is never left empty.",
  "helpBody2c": "You can search for words like museum, restaurant, park, beach, or viewpoint to find real places.",
  "helpBody2d": "Use category, price, distance, and kid-friendly filters to refine the results.",
  "helpBody3a": "Explore tours created by the community or generated by our AI.",
  "helpBody3b": "Use the top search bar to search for tours by name or keyword.",
  "helpBody3c": "Tap the filter icon to refine your search by category, price, and more.",
  "helpBody4a": "Visualize tourist spots, events, and points of interest directly on the map.",
  "helpBody4b": "Tap on pins to view a quick place card.",
  "helpBody4c": "Tapping a card opens the place details where you can save it, check availability if it's a restaurant/hotel, or start a route there.",
  "helpBody5a": "Create your own tours by adding a name, description, and cover image.",
  "helpBody5b": "Add stops (places) by searching for them in our map-connected database.",
  "helpBody5c": "You can define how many people and how many days the tour lasts.",
  "helpBody6a": "Generate a complete tour simply by describing what you want to see and do using AI.",
  "helpBody6b": "You can use advanced options to specify whether it lasts days or hours.",
  "helpBody6c": "Once the tour is generated, you can save it to your account or edit it to add or remove stops before saving.",
  "helpBody7a": "You can edit your created tours in the 'My Tours' section.",
  "helpBody7b": "Save your favorite places and organize them to access them quickly.",
  "helpBody8a": "Complete your tourist profile by choosing your favorite interests and categories.",
  "helpBody8b": "Change your photo, name, and language/theme preferences.",
  "helpBody9a": "Send Requests, Complaints, Claims, and Suggestions (PQRS) directly from the app.",
  "helpBody9b": "Check the status of your PQRS and administrator responses in the 'History' tab.",
